# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CooL — environment
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env.local` is gitignored and must stay
# that way: SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY bypasses every row-level security policy
# in the database.
#
# For local development run `supabase start`, then `supabase status` prints
# every value below.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Supabase ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The API URL. Safe to expose — it is in the browser bundle by design.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL="http://127.0.0.1:54321"

# The service role key. NEVER prefix this with NEXT_PUBLIC_, never import it
# from a client component, and never commit it. Every portal table has RLS
# enabled with zero policies, so this key is the only path to investor data —
# which also means leaking it is equivalent to publishing the data room.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=""

# ── Investor sessions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Encrypts the session JWE (A256GCM). Minimum 32 characters, enforced at
# startup. Generate one with:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64url'))"
#
# Rotating this invalidates every live investor session immediately, which is
# the intended break-glass control.
INVESTOR_SESSION_SECRET=""

# ── Admin access ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The admin console is protected by a single shared passphrase rather than by
# accounts, because there is one admin today and an account system nobody needs
# is an attack surface nobody is maintaining. Minimum 24 characters.
#
# When a second admin exists, replace this with Supabase Auth + an allowlist —
# see docs/DEPLOYMENT.md. Do not solve it by sharing the passphrase.
ADMIN_PASSPHRASE=""

# Same rules as INVESTOR_SESSION_SECRET, and it must be a DIFFERENT value:
# reusing one secret for both means an investor session token and an admin
# session token are forgeable from each other.
ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=""

# ── Contact form ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where /contact submissions are delivered. Leave blank to disable delivery;
# the form still validates and still records, it just does not send.
CONTACT_INBOX="info.quantumbay@gmail.com"
